00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:53.820
Is seltzer water
unhealthier than flat water?

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:54.653
Oh man.

00:02:54.653 --> 00:02:56.130
The reality about sparkling water

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:58.020
is the only population
of people that I say

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:59.700
should be careful with sparkling water

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:01.350
are people who have acid reflux.

00:03:01.350 --> 00:03:02.820
Because if you already have some acid

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:05.400
leaking outside the
gut into the esophagus,

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:06.750
having bubbles in there,

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:08.580
you could actually expand the stomach more

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:09.720
and cause more of that leaky gut,

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:10.830
especially with burping and stuff.

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.030
Then everything else,

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:13.290
it's kind of not so bad.

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:16.110
It might be slightly more
acidic than tap water,

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:18.270
especially if it has some
like flavorings in it.

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:20.610
But dentists say like if
you drink it with a meal

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:22.290
or if you drink some water right after it,

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:23.670
like plain water, you're fine.

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:25.110
If you're replacing soda,

00:03:25.110 --> 00:03:26.730
like sugary soda with seltzer,

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:28.027
dang right it's good for you.

