00:07:33.127 --> 00:07:35.790
"Why aren't over-the-counter
medication dosages

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:36.623
based on weight?

00:07:36.623 --> 00:07:38.640
They're only based on whether
you're a kid or an adult."

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:40.770
Well, it matters more when you're a kid.

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:41.910
Weight-based dosages.

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:42.743
As an adult,

00:07:42.743 --> 00:07:44.520
you have a healthy liver and kidney

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:47.040
so that like you have
normal functioning organs.

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:49.020
There's also a really important takeaway.

00:07:49.020 --> 00:07:49.853
Plan B.

00:07:49.853 --> 00:07:52.830
A medication that you use
as emergency contraception

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:54.180
may not work as well

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:57.240
in those are who are over
a certain number of pounds.

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:59.160
So please be aware of that

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:01.110
and speak to your doctor
about that situation.

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:02.640
I've seen people not know that

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:03.960
and then make some bad decisions.

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:05.617
